        {
          "text": " Naye akasema, Mjakazi wako na aone kibali machoni pako. Basi huyo mwanamke akaenda zake, naye akala chakula, wala uso wake haukuhuzunika tena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.18",
