                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wakaondoka asubuhi na mapema, wakaomba mbele za BWANA, kisha wakarejea na kufika nyumbani kwao huko Rama; Elkana akamjua mkewe Hana; naye BWANA akamkumbuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
