        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha yule mtu, Elkana, na watu wote wa nyumbani mwake, wakakwea kwenda kumtolea BWANA dhabihu ya mwaka, na nadhiri yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.21",
